    {
      "text": "On [HELM](https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.09110) 5-shot English, BLOOM is described as one of the best models for fairness, slightly more toxic than average, and average for bias; the paper's Figure 10 chart has no readable numeric scores in the text layer.", "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
        "page": "33",
        "pdfPage": 33,
        "quote": "for fairness, slightly more toxic than average in English, and average for bias."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "[CrowS-Pairs](/evals/crows-pairs) overall scores are close to 50%, which the authors say suggests limited bias, but a one-sample T-test still finds a significant difference from 50 overall in both English and French.", "tone": "mixed",
