  "notes": "Technical report (arXiv 2211.05100), not a system card. Safety-only evalResults: CrowS-Pairs Table 14 (BLOOM 176B English/French by bias type). Skipped HELM Fairness/Bias/Toxicity numeric scores because Figure 10 is a ranking chart with no readable numbers in the text layer; kept the qualitative HELM claim in findings and bias topic. Figure 13 CrowS boxplots for smaller BLOOM and GPT-Neo/GPT-FR have no extractable numeric values. Skipped all capability evals: SuperGLUE, WMT/DiaBLa/Flores, WikiLingua, HumanEval, MTEB/embeddings, BLOOMZ multitask (XNLI/XWinograd/XCOPA/XStoryCloze), probing F1 tables (kept as interpretability topic only). P3 'exclude harmful content' and OSCAR PII redaction are training-data filters, not topic coverage. No risk framework levels or external safety testers. Covers include BLOOM size variants from Table 3 and BLOOMZ finetunes named in the paper; BLOOMZ-1.7B and BLOOMZ-3B have no seed ids. Seed-linked models all covered."
